---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '26 October 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Sapiogen AI privacy policy — what information we collect, how we use it, and how to request its deletion."
>

  <section class="page-lede">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="sec-index">Privacy policy</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy policy<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Short version: we only collect what we need to answer you, we don&rsquo;t
        sell it, and we delete it on request. Full version follows.
      </p>
      <p class="mono last-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Sapiogen AI (&ldquo;Sapiogen&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;)
        is an AI-first software engineering studio based at Yamuna Complex,
        Ganga Jammuna Complex, 5, Chimanlal Girdharlal Road, Navrangpura,
        Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380009, India. We can be reached at
        <a href="mailto:hello@sapiogenai.com" class="link-rule">hello@sapiogenai.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect only information you provide directly:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> name, email, company (optional), interest, budget (optional), and the message you write.</li>
        <li><strong>Careers form:</strong> name, email, phone (optional), role of interest, portfolio and LinkedIn URLs, years of experience, and the message you write.</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> IP address, user agent, and timestamp for every API request, used to prevent abuse and debug problems.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use third-party analytics, cross-site tracking, or advertising cookies on this website.</p>

      <h2>3. How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry or application.</li>
        <li>To keep records of applications so we can refer back to them during hiring.</li>
        <li>To prevent abuse of our forms (rate limiting, spam detection).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We never sell your information, and we never use it for marketing to unrelated third parties.</p>

      <h2>4. Where it&rsquo;s stored</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are stored in a MongoDB Atlas database. Server
        infrastructure is operated by third-party hosting providers under
        standard commercial agreements that include confidentiality and
        security obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact enquiries: up to 24 months, then deleted or anonymised.</li>
        <li>Job applications: up to 24 months unless you ask us to delete them sooner.</li>
        <li>Server logs: rotated at 30 days.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us at any time to show you what we have, correct it, or
        delete it. Email
        <a href="mailto:hello@sapiogenai.com" class="link-rule">hello@sapiogenai.com</a>
        with the request and we will act on it within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We do not set tracking cookies. The site may set first-party cookies
        strictly necessary for security headers or form session integrity.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Children</h2>
      <p>
        This website is not directed to children under 16, and we do not
        knowingly collect their information.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy materially changes, we will update the date at the top
        of this page and, where appropriate, notify affected individuals
        directly.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, concerns, or requests:
        <a href="mailto:hello@sapiogenai.com" class="link-rule">hello@sapiogenai.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .legal h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal p { color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: 68ch; }
  .legal ul { list-style: none; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .legal ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal ul li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0.8em;
    width: 8px; height: 1px;
    background: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .legal strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
</style>
